  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Hei Cheng sends Immortal Gu House Dark Prison at the silver giant like a meteor. Inside that giant, three Gu Immortals use three defensive immortal killer moves together. Heavenly stem earth veil is named with star cloud grindstone and forceful mountain shield. At once, three arms of the silver giant transform.",
