        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The third arm hangs by the giant’s side. It seems to grasp a translucent light yellow veil, less eye-catching than the other two moves. After the star cloud grindstone explodes and a navy blue shield breaks, Dark Prison crashes into the heavenly stem earth veil. The house is weak and powerless, its force already spent. It hits the silver giant’s chest and only causes inconsequential damage.",
